 can review, faster updates by @RaghavChamadiya in https://github.com/repowise-dev/repowise/pull/5249\n\n\n**Full Changelog**: https://github.com/repowise-dev/repowise/compare/v0.60.0...v0.60.1","mentions_count":2}
